.cargo/
# Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: this is a binary crate, and the Dockerfile builds
# with --locked so image builds cannot drift from the reviewed dependency set.
target/
outputs/
attachments/
tests/
*.swp
*.swo
deploy/
.env
config.toml
a2a_board/
data/
config.toml
.hermes
docs/

# ── crates/ 的集成测试需要入库 ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# 上面的 `tests/` 规则针对 gateway 自身的本地测试套件（不入库）；
# mail-anchor 是独立 crate，它的向量驱动测试必须随 crate 一起版本化。
!crates/mail-anchor/tests/
!crates/mail-anchor/tests/**
